hor involved in research on intravascular complications of central venous catheterization."}{"title": "RUPP SM:Rupp SM is an author who contributed to practice guidelines for central venous access."}{"title": "APFELBAUM JL:Apfelbaum JL is an author who co-authored practice guidelines for central venous access."}{"title": "JOYNT GM:Joynt GM is an author who studied deep venous thrombosis caused by femoral venous catheters."}{"title": "KEW J:Kew J is an author involved in research on deep venous thrombosis in critically ill patients."}{"title": "GOMERSALL CD:Gomersall CD is an author who contributed to the study of deep venous thrombosis in critically ill patients."}{"title": "TIMSIT JF:Timsit JF is an author who researched jugular versus femoral short-term catheterization and risk of infection."}{"title": "BOUADMA L:Bouadma L is an author involved in the study of catheterization and infection risk."}{"title": "MIMOZ O:Mimoz O is an author who contributed to research on catheterization and infection risk."}{"title": "CHOPRA V:Chopra V is an author who studied the risk of bloodstream infection associated with peripherally inserted central catheters."}{"title": "FLANDERS SA:Flanders SA is an author involved in research on intravenous catheters and infection risk."}{"title": "SAINT S:Saint S is an author who contributed to the study of intravenous catheters and infection risk."}{"title": "GRANT J:Grant J is an author who wrote about catheter access in parenteral nutrition."}{"title": "WHITE KG:White KG is an author who contributed to the study of parenteral nutrition solutions."}{"title": "ATTAR A:Attar A is an author who researched evidence-based prevention of catheter infection during parenteral nutrition."}{"title": "WOLFE BM:Wolfe BM is an author who studied complications of parenteral nutrition."}{"title": "RYDER MA:Ryder MA is an author who contributed to research on complications of parenteral nutrition."}{"title": "NISHIKAWA RA:Nishikawa RA is an author involved 