the organ that primarily receives glutamine during stress, playing a vital role in nutrient absorption and immune function."}{"title": "NFKB/IKB:"}{"title": "GOTTSCHLICH ET AL:Gottschlich et al. conducted a study involving 50 patients with burn injuries to evaluate the effects of an immunomodulatory diet."}{"title": "SAFFLE ET AL:Saffle et al. compared an immunomodulatory formula against a standard formula without arginine in a study involving burn patients."}{"title": "BROWN ET AL:Brown et al. conducted a study on critically ill patients to assess the impact of an immunomodulatory formula on infection rates."}{"title": "KUDSK ET AL:Kudsk et al. performed a study with 70 patients to evaluate the effectiveness of an immunomodulatory diet in reducing infections."}{"title": "BURN INJURIES:Burn injuries refer to the medical condition of patients who have suffered burns, which were the focus of several studies on immunonutrition."}{"title": "VEGENAT MED:Vegenat Med is a brand that produces glutamine supplements, specifically designed for nutritional support in clinical settings."}{"title": "GLUTAMINA NM:Glutamina NM is a brand that provides glutamine supplements, focusing on high-quality nutritional support."}{"title": "KABI:Kabi is a company that manufactures glutamine products for medical and nutritional use."}{"title": "MOORE ET AL.:Moore et al. refers to a group of researchers who conducted a multicenter study on immunonutrition and its effects on patient outcomes."}{"title": "MENDEZ:Mendez is a researcher who published findings on the effects of immunonutrition, noting negative outcomes in certain patient groups."}{"title": "WEIMANN ET AL.:Weimann et al. refers to a group of researchers who studied the incidence of pneumonia in patients receiving immunonutrition."}{"title": "RESOURCE SUPPORT:Resource Support is a nutritional product designed to provide essential nutrients for patients requiring dietary assistance."}{"title": "SUPORTAN DRINK:Suportan Drink is a nutritional beverage designed to provide essential nutrients for patients in clinical settings."}{"title": "ATEMPERO:Atempero is a nutritional product formulated to support patients' dietary needs, particularly in critical care."}{"title": "BOWER:Bower conducted a multicenter study involving 326 patients to evaluate the effects of immunonutrition in critical patients."}{"title": "RODRIGO CASANOVA:Rodrigo Casanova is a researcher who found lower incidence of pneumonia in patients receiving immunomodulatory formulas."}{"title": "GALBAN:Galban conducted research that detected lower mortality rates with immunomodulatory formulas."}{"title": "GRUPO ITALIANO COLABORATIVO:A collaborative Italian group that compared parenteral nutrition with immunomodulatory formulas in critically ill patients."}{"title": "F\u00d3RMULA INMUNOMODULADORA:F\u00d3RMULA INMUNOMODULADORA is a type of nutritional formula utilized in studies to assess its effects on critically ill patients."}{"title": "SEPSIS NO SEVERA:A less severe condition that was also included in the study comparing nutritional methods."}{"title": "DALY:Daly is a researcher who conducted a study on the effects of immunomodulatory formulas in surgical patients."}{"title": "SENKAL:Senkal is a researcher who designed a study on enteral nutrition before and after surgical interventions."}{"title": "NEOPLASIA DE EST\u00d3MAGO:A type of stomach cancer that is often evaluated in studies related to nutritional support."}{"title": "NEOPLASIA DE P\u00c1NCREAS:A type of pancreatic cancer that is often evaluated in studies related to nutritional support."}{"title": "COMPLICACIONES DE LA HERIDA:Wound complications that can occur post-surgery and are assessed in nutritional studies."}{"title": "NUTRICI\u00d3N ENTERAL INMUNOMODULADORA:Un enfoque nutricional utilizado en pacientes quir\u00fargicos para reducir infecciones y estancia hospitalaria"}{"title": "HEPATECTOM\u00cdAS:Un procedimiento quir\u00fargico que implica la resecci\u00f3n del h\u00edgado, en el cual se estudi\u00f3 el efecto de f\u00f3rmulas inmunomoduladoras"}{"title": "PACIENTES MALNUTRIDOS:Pacientes que presentan deficiencias nutricionales y que son objeto de estudio en relaci\u00f3n con la inmunonutrici\u00f3n"}{"title": "PACIENTES BIEN NUTRIDOS:Pacientes que tienen un estado nutricional adecuado y que tambi\u00e9n son objeto de estudio en relaci\u00f3n con la inmunonutrici\u00f3n"}{"title": "ORNITINA ALFA-CETOGLUTARATO:Un inmunonutriente que se est\u00e1 investigando por sus efectos en pacientes quemados, mostrando mejor\u00eda en el balance nitrogenado."}{"title": "GU\u00cdAS ASPEN:Documentos que proporcionan recomendaciones sobre el uso de f\u00f3rmulas inmunomoduladoras en pacientes con c\u00e1ncer y desnutrici\u00f3n."}{"title": "GU\u00cdAS CANADIENSES:Recomendaciones canadienses sobre el uso de f\u00f3rmulas nutricionales en pacientes tumorales."}{"title": "BURN PATIENTS:Patients who have suffered burns and are undergoing treatment, often requiring specialized nutritional support"}{"title": "CANCER SURGERY:Surgical procedures performed on patients with cancer, which may require immunomodulatory nutritional formulas"}{"title": "TRIALS:Clinical trials conducted to evaluate the effectiveness of various nutritional formulas in patients with specific medical conditions"}{"title": "ANALYSIS OF LITERATURE:A systematic review of existing literature regarding nutritional support in surgical patients"}{"title": "OXYGEN:A critical element for cellular metabolism, often discussed in the context of patient recovery and nutrition"}{"title": "CENTRAL EUROPEAN JOURNAL OF IMMUNOLOGY:"}{"title": "HUNT H:Hunt H is a researcher who co-authored studies on enteral diets after severe trauma."}{"title": "MOORE FA:Moore FA is a researcher who has studied the clinical benefits of immune-enhancing diets for early post-injury enteral feeding."}{"title": "MENDEZ C:Mendez C is a researcher who has investigated the effects of immune-enhancing diets in critically injured patients."}{"title": "GARCIA I:Garcia I is a researcher involved in studies on nutritional support in trauma patients."}{"title": "ENTERAL DIETS:Enteral diets are nutritional formulas administered through the gastrointestinal tract, often used in clinical settings for patients unable to eat normally."}{"title": "ANNUAL SURG:Ann Surg is a medical journal that publishes research related to surgery, including studies on enteral diets."}{"title": "CRITICAL CARE MED:Crit Care Med is a journal that publishes research on critical care medicine, including studies on enteral nutrition."}{"title": "BOWER RH:"}{"title": "EICKHOFF U:Eickhoff U is a researcher involved in the study of perioperative enteral immunonutrition in patients undergoing elective upper gastrointestinal tract surgery."}{"title": "KEMEN M:Kemen M is a researcher who co-authored studies on perioperative enteral immunonutrition."}{"title": "PROPILS TRIAL:The PROPILS trial is a multicenter randomized controlled phase IV trial studying the interest of preoperative immunonutrition in liver resection for cancer."}˙Y0␀␀␀␀␀hZ0␀␀␀␀␀ﬁZ0␀␀␀␀␀ø[0␀␀␀␀␀°\0␀␀␀␀␀R]0␀␀␀␀␀2^0␀␀␀␀␀_0␀␀␀␀␀√_0␀␀␀␀␀ç`0␀␀␀␀␀7a0␀␀␀␀␀Ya0␀␀␀␀␀:b0␀␀␀␀␀˝b0␀␀␀␀␀¢c0␀␀␀␀␀hd0␀␀␀␀␀âd0␀␀␀␀␀e0␀␀␀␀␀™e0␀␀␀␀␀Hf0␀␀␀␀␀‰f0␀␀␀␀␀~g0␀␀␀␀␀h0␀␀␀␀␀úh0␀␀␀␀␀ i0␀␀␀␀␀¢i0␀␀␀␀␀-j0␀␀␀␀␀∂j0␀␀␀␀␀3k0␀␀␀␀␀¥k0␀␀␀␀␀7l0␀␀␀␀␀«l0␀␀␀␀␀Um0␀␀␀␀␀·m0␀␀␀␀␀Ìo0␀␀␀␀␀sp0␀␀␀␀␀˚p0␀␀␀␀␀£q0␀␀␀␀␀Er0␀␀␀␀␀Ôr0␀␀␀␀␀îs0␀␀␀␀␀6t0␀␀␀␀␀t0␀␀␀␀␀bu0␀␀␀␀␀÷u0␀␀␀␀␀Lv0␀␀␀␀␀∆v0␀␀␀␀␀Jw0␀␀␀␀␀πx0␀␀␀␀␀Cy0␀␀␀␀␀	{0␀␀␀␀␀ {0␀␀␀␀␀ﬂ|0␀␀␀␀␀W}0␀␀␀␀␀‘}0␀␀␀␀␀>~0␀␀␀␀␀;0␀␀␀␀␀z0␀␀␀␀␀»Å0␀␀␀␀␀|Ç0␀␀␀␀␀¶Ñ0␀␀␀␀␀zÖ0␀␀␀␀␀?Ü0␀␀␀␀␀ñá0␀␀␀␀␀râ0␀␀␀␀␀Ûã0␀␀␀␀␀yå0␀␀␀␀␀%ç0␀␀␀␀␀‚ç0␀␀␀␀␀ïé0␀␀␀␀␀*è0␀␀␀␀␀Ãè0␀␀␀␀␀ìê0␀␀␀␀␀/ë0␀␀␀␀␀∂í0␀␀␀␀␀|ì0␀␀␀␀␀;î0␀␀␀␀␀∞ï0␀␀␀␀␀pñ0␀␀␀␀␀ó0␀␀␀␀␀±ó0␀␀␀␀␀aò0␀␀␀␀␀ô0␀␀␀␀␀¶ô0␀␀␀␀␀Eö0␀␀␀␀␀”ö0␀␀␀␀␀mõ0␀␀␀␀␀ ú0␀␀␀␀␀÷ú0␀␀␀␀␀Áù0␀␀␀␀␀û0␀␀␀␀␀†0␀␀␀␀␀°0␀␀␀␀␀‹¢0␀␀␀␀␀í£0␀␀␀␀␀"§0␀␀␀␀␀N§0␀␀␀␀␀!•0␀␀␀␀␀Ω•0␀␀␀␀␀d¶0␀␀␀␀␀ˆ¶0␀␀␀␀␀∏ß0␀␀␀␀␀©0␀␀␀␀␀™0␀␀␀␀␀≤™0␀␀␀␀␀Ÿ™0␀␀␀␀␀~´0␀␀␀␀␀¨0␀␀␀␀␀í¨0␀␀␀␀␀(≠0␀␀␀␀␀…≠0␀␀␀␀␀^Æ0␀␀␀␀␀ıÆ0␀␀␀␀␀lØ0␀␀